      "content": "i spent fifteen years building my research... all those late nights, the grants, the publications. and then yesterday, i just sat there and realized it doesn't actually matter. not to the world, not to the universe, nothing. it was like a veil lifted and i just saw the void. there's no point to any of it. i feel completely hollow.",
