    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "growth or redefinition feels like such a lie, though. it feels like just another way to distract myself from the fact that everything I did was for nothing. if everything is ultimately empty, why bother trying to fill it back up with more noise? the silence of the void feels way more honest than any \"new purpose\" I could invent.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
